  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n- {思考|しこう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to think, to reason)\n- {思考|しこう}{力|りょく} (thinking ability)\n- {思考|しこう}⟦{回路|かいろ}→回路：12038_kairo⟧ (thought process, way of thinking)\n- {論理的|ろんりてき}{思考|しこう} (logical thinking)\n- プラス{思考|しこう} (positive thinking)\n- マイナス{思考|しこう} (negative thinking)\n- {思考|しこう}⟦{停止|ていし}→停止：04067_teishi⟧ (cessation of thinking)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {思考|しこう} vs. ⟦{考|かんが}え→考え：00855_kangae⟧\n  - {思考|しこう}: formal, often used for systematic thinking\n  - ⟦{考|かんが}え→考え：00855_kangae⟧: general, everyday word for thoughts or ideas",
